OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'thrown out of bed' by force
OL,4,Aof explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was "thrown out of bed" by
OL,7,Fthe force of a gas explosion at a block
OL,8,Fof flats helped another resident to
OL,9,Fsafety, a trial has heard.
OL,11,FTen people died following the explosion
OL,12,Fnear Haut du Mont flats in the early
OL,13,Fhours of 10 December 2022.
OL,15,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,16,Fand Lee Ward all deny 10 counts of
OL,17,Fgross negligence manslaughter, while
OL,18,FIsland Energy has pleaded not guilty to
OL,19,Fhealth and safety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
