OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'thrown out of bed' by force
OL,4,Aof explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecution Advocate Simon Thomas told
OL,7,Fthe jury Kathy McGinness, 73, helped
OL,8,Fofficers "with ensuring the safe
OL,9,Fevacuation of another resident".
OL,10,FMcGinness subsequently died from her
OL,11,Finjuries in hospital on Christmas Day.
